  "extends": [
    {
      "itemId": "{{post}}",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "New versions of major features on the CIIP platform, and API rework and redesign across its endpoints, services, DTOs and schema, inside an agile team working in Jira, Confluence and Bitbucket, on Spring Boot with a Nuxt/Vue front end and OpenSearch.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "document": "2026-09-09_cv-en_ownership-application-management",
              "said": "Developer engineer on the CIIP teaching-media platform inside an agile team (Jira, Confluence, Bitbucket): new versions of major features, API rework and redesign (endpoints, services, DTOs, schema), large Flyway migrations on the MySQL schema, bug fixes, pull requests peer-reviewed both ways, and ownership of the Kubernetes workloads' service layer through to production releases, urgent corrections travelling a dedicated hotfix pipeline. Spring Boot, Nuxt/Vue, OpenSearch."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cypress end-to-end suites authored to autograde student web labs across semesters, beside live unblocking and grading in the lab sessions of the three courses.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "document": "2026-09-09_cv-en_ownership-application-management",
              "said": "Supported students hands-on in the lab sessions of three courses (web technologies, programming, DevOps): live unblocking, grading, and Cypress end-to-end suites authored to autograde student web labs across semesters."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Applied AI feasibility studies for armasuisse and Planair on self-hosted models, driven by their data-sovereignty requirements, and daily work with AI coding agents whose output is reviewed and tested before it lands.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "document": "2026-09-09_cv-en_ownership-application-management",
              "said": "Built with AI coding agents daily, agent output reviewed and tested before it lands, and ran applied AI feasibility studies for armasuisse and Planair on self-hosted models, driven by their data-sovereignty requirements."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "itemId": "{{nestle}}",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The six business-critical solutions were .NET solutions, SSRS, a high-traffic intranet, and R&D and recipe-management platforms.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "document": "2026-09-09_cv-en_ownership-application-management",
              "said": "Technical SPOC for ~120 globally used business applications, including 6 business-critical solutions (.NET solutions, SSRS, high-traffic intranet, R&D and recipe-management platforms), on ~200 production application servers of ~600 across all environments."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L3 Global Business Solution sustain on those solutions: incident and problem resolution, structured root cause analysis (GSTD), runbooks and documentation, then the handover to the offshore team in Chennai - trainings, documentation and knowledge transfer for 6 business-critical solutions and 4 shared environments hosting 120 web applications - monitored through the transition.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "document": "2026-09-09_cv-en_ownership-application-management",
              "said": "L3 Global Business Solution sustain: incident and problem resolution on the business-critical solutions, structured root cause analysis (GSTD), runbooks and documentation. Handed the sustain over to the offshore team in Chennai (trainings, documentation, knowledge transfer for 6 business-critical solutions and 4 shared environments hosting 120 web applications) and monitored the transition."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Change Board approval across Globe IS/IT: compliance-by-design checks, QA gates, tested release plans, and PrePROD and PROD implementation instructions with rollback plans, with the Change & Release process training delivered across the organisation.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "document": "2026-09-09_cv-en_ownership-application-management",
              "said": "Accredited Change Board approver across Globe IS/IT: compliance-by-design checks, QA gates, tested release plans, PrePROD and PROD implementation instructions with rollback plans. Delivered Change & Release process training across the organisation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Directed solution go-lives with business acceptance and functional testing, coordinated the application-server migration to Windows Server 2008 (~$5M support costs avoided), ran the 4S managed-services DEV environment of 120 servers (~$8M saved yearly) and executed the \"Call to Arms\" security compliance project across 170 applications, 200 servers and 900 accounts.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "document": "2026-09-09_cv-en_ownership-application-management",
              "said": "Directed solution go-lives with business acceptance and functional testing. Coordinated the application-server migration to Windows Server 2008 (~$5M support costs avoided), ran the 4S managed-services DEV environment of 120 servers (~$8M saved yearly) and executed the \"Call to Arms\" security compliance project across 170 applications, 200 servers and 900 accounts."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "children": []
