              "said": "Opendidac, 2022 - 2026: Open-source platform for training exercises and summative exams, operated through sessions where a failure reaches students' academic records. Adopted voluntarily across 20+ courses and 1,000+ students a year, every professor who took it up stayed, and it took over the exam use case the incumbent platform had never significantly covered. Next.js, PostgreSQL, Prisma, OIDC, Electron, GitHub Actions."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
