          "text": "A multi-service Spring Boot architecture with a central identity service, carrying 230,000+ tracked resource interactions, released to production by the team this post's holder was the developer engineer of. Nuxt / Vue.js, OpenSearch, Flyway, Bitbucket Pipelines.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "document": "2026-09-09_cv-en_ownership-application-management",
              "said": "CIIP Platform, 2024 - 2026: Teaching-media management and educational coordination platform for the public schools of Suisse romande and Ticino: 43,000+ teacher accounts, 565 schools, 15+ federated identity providers, 230,000+ tracked resource interactions. Multi-service Spring Boot architecture with a central identity service, developer engineer in the team through to production releases. Spring Boot, Java, MySQL, Kubernetes, Nuxt / Vue.js, OpenSearch, Flyway, Bitbucket Pipelines."
            }
          ]
